% RETRANSITION, bars 241-256, poco a poco accelerando to Tempo I.
% The introduction again, compressed: timpani motive x on B; Hn 1 G sharp (241-244) falls to G natural (245): E major turns to E minor;
% the head of theme A in the violas (245), Vln II (249) and Vln I (253), pp, over the pizzicato B.
% c013: bass A (iv) at 247 before the B pedal (249), so the returning V is approached from the subdominant (Aldwell-Schachter Unit 26 sec. 15, PDF 456).

